# prefix-block-directive-closes-block

## Input

```
outer.
  a 1
#dir args
b 2

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..27
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..13
    WORD_KEY@0..6
      WORD@0..6 "outer."
    NEWLINE@6..7 "\n"
    SPACE@7..9 "  "
    ENTRY@9..13
      WORD_KEY@9..10
        WORD@9..10 "a"
      SPACE@10..11 " "
      INTEGER@11..12
        NUMERAL@11..12 "1"
      NEWLINE@12..13 "\n"
  DIRECTIVE@13..23
    SHARP@13..14 "#"
    WORD@14..17 "dir"
    SPACE@17..18 " "
    LINE_STRING@18..22
      STRING@18..22 "args"
    NEWLINE@22..23 "\n"
  ENTRY@23..27
    WORD_KEY@23..24
      WORD@23..24 "b"
    SPACE@24..25 " "
    INTEGER@25..26
      NUMERAL@25..26 "2"
    NEWLINE@26..27 "\n"
```

